00:59:30.541 --> 00:59:36.083
One of the most insidious elements of a confidence scam is 
that the victims who invested the most

00:59:36.083 --> 00:59:41.833
are often the most passionate defenders, because shame is a 
powerful force in the human psyche,

00:59:41.833 --> 00:59:44.916
and they can’t bear the shame of admitting they were 
tricked.

00:59:44.916 --> 00:59:50.333
This results in Q believers growing more and more 
passionate, getting more and more involved,

00:59:50.333 --> 00:59:56.083
and further isolating themselves from others, particularly 
people who push back against their evangelism.

00:59:56.083 --> 01:00:01.833
The end result is Q believers only socializing with other Q 
believers.

