01:06:41.000 --> 01:06:47.291
Like Flat Earth, there is a sympathetic nugget in the 
anxiety that the world has gotten too complex,

01:06:47.291 --> 01:06:52.625
that things are spinning out of control, but the Q analysis 
of the problem

01:06:52.625 --> 01:06:57.416
is that the fault lies with the people outlining the 
complexity.

01:06:57.416 --> 01:07:03.166
The purpose of cosmologies like Q, like Flat Earth, is to 
simplify the world.

01:07:03.166 --> 01:07:05.458
And, I know, that sounds ridiculous.

01:07:05.458 --> 01:07:09.083
The irony here is that this isn’t all that far off base.

01:07:09.083 --> 01:07:15.458
Now, not this specific example, the QAnon map of global 
politics is almost pure nonsense,

01:07:15.458 --> 01:07:18.125
but the shape of it isn’t.

01:07:18.125 --> 01:07:23.125
If you were to map out the political landscape of the world 
it would look a lot like this:

01:07:23.125 --> 01:07:28.833
thousands of political entities, big and small, all with 
their own goals, values, and incentives,

01:07:28.833 --> 01:07:34.625
navigating an equally complex series of conflicts, 
alliances, and rivalries in competition for

01:07:34.625 --> 01:07:36.875
power, fame, or limited resources.

01:07:36.875 --> 01:07:40.625
So how is something like this making the world simpler?

01:07:40.625 --> 01:07:47.708
Because it takes all this, the chaos of millions of 
individuals trying to reshape the world in their own way,

01:07:47.708 --> 01:07:51.875
for good or ill, and turns it into a single entity.

01:07:51.875 --> 01:07:56.458
All the world’s complexity, all the chaos, it’s all the 
fault of one group.

01:07:56.458 --> 01:08:03.333
Not an ideology, not a worldview, not historical inertia, 
not anything so nebulous as the way we think about the 
world.

01:08:03.333 --> 01:08:07.750
A single, tangible, identifiable group with a written 
agenda.

01:08:07.750 --> 01:08:12.083
These types of conspiratorial beliefs, for all their complex
 cosmologies,

01:08:12.083 --> 01:08:15.416
exist in opposition to structural challenges,

01:08:15.416 --> 01:08:20.208
and a lot of people get involved because they resent 
structural criticism.

01:08:20.208 --> 01:08:26.208
Structural criticism poses that we are the way we are 
because of complicated forces,

01:08:26.208 --> 01:08:31.750
some intentional and many not, that have compounded and 
morphed over generations.

01:08:31.750 --> 01:08:35.000
There’s no plan, no template, and no goal.

01:08:35.000 --> 01:08:40.208
The world won’t just magically morph into a better place as 
a function of its existence:

01:08:40.208 --> 01:08:46.250
we are responsible for confronting the past, fixing the 
present, and shaping the future.

01:08:46.250 --> 01:08:51.958
QAnon, and not just QAnon, many people, many many people, 
want to believe that things

01:08:51.958 --> 01:08:57.541
are the way they are because someone has deliberately 
crafted it to be that way,

01:08:57.541 --> 01:09:02.791
that there is a natural order to the world, and we need to 
just trust the plan.

01:09:02.791 --> 01:09:06.958
Climate scientists, trans and queer activists, women’s 
rights, reproductive autonomy,

01:09:06.958 --> 01:09:12.125
racial justice, protests against police brutality, protests 
against generational wealth inequality,

01:09:12.125 --> 01:09:16.458
and protests against the increasing transfer of the public 
good into the hands of

01:09:16.458 --> 01:09:23.250
corporations for privatization and exploitation, all of them
 interlocking, systemic issues.

01:09:23.250 --> 01:09:27.708
These are, inarguably, disruptions of the status quo, 
confrontations of

01:09:27.708 --> 01:09:33.583
deep-rooted complexities that intersect the lives and 
futures of billions of people.

01:09:33.583 --> 01:09:38.583
And it is that disruption, not the underlying injustices, 
not the underlying conflicts,

01:09:38.583 --> 01:09:45.375
that make QAnon anxious, that make QAnon feel like the world
 has gotten too complex.

01:09:45.375 --> 01:09:51.291
They don’t want those complexities to exist, and by talking 
about them you make them exist.

01:09:51.291 --> 01:09:53.833
It’s a form of magical thought.

01:09:53.833 --> 01:09:59.291
Talking about police brutality wills police brutality into 
existence.

01:09:59.291 --> 01:10:05.291
A disruption of the status quo is seen as a disruption of 
the natural order.

01:10:05.291 --> 01:10:10.500
The problem they see is that no one has made those people 
shut up.

01:10:10.500 --> 01:10:15.500
That is what they want: someone to come in and make those 
people shut up and go away,

01:10:15.500 --> 01:10:18.458
to put things back “where they belong”.

01:10:18.458 --> 01:10:21.541
Now, this is not a philosophy unique to QAnon,

01:10:21.541 --> 01:10:24.958
it’s the lifeblood of all reactionary movements.

01:10:24.958 --> 01:10:28.000
They are, of course, in conflict with facts.

01:10:28.000 --> 01:10:33.916
Global warming, to pull one example, is real, and an 
existential threat to civilization.

01:10:33.916 --> 01:10:35.791
That’s just a fact.

01:10:35.791 --> 01:10:38.916
It wasn’t willed into existence by people talking about it,

01:10:38.916 --> 01:10:42.500
it isn’t over-tuned leftists looking for patterns in clouds,

01:10:42.500 --> 01:10:48.958
it’s the byproduct of dumping carbon dioxide into the 
atmosphere on an industrial scale for two hundred years.

01:10:48.958 --> 01:10:52.333
And there is a temptation to engage on that level,

01:10:52.333 --> 01:11:00.291
to confront all the material ways in which they are just 
wrong, and it largely does not work.

01:11:00.291 --> 01:11:05.458
And what’s unique about QAnon is the degree to which it 
doesn’t work,

01:11:05.458 --> 01:11:09.458
the degree to which the movement is immune to evidence.

01:11:09.458 --> 01:11:12.750
All reactionary movements are in tension with reality,

01:11:12.750 --> 01:11:16.416
a tension that eventually results in psychological crisis,

01:11:16.416 --> 01:11:20.583
and belief systems like QAnon are the endpoint of that 
crisis,

01:11:20.583 --> 01:11:23.708
the point where reality itself becomes an enemy.

01:11:23.708 --> 01:11:27.583
Because ultimately it’s not about facts, it’s about power.

01:11:27.583 --> 01:11:32.125
QAnons are not otherwise empty vessels who believe one 
whacky thing.

01:11:32.125 --> 01:11:33.750
They have an agenda.

01:11:33.750 --> 01:11:40.333
QAnon, what it accepts, what it believes, is driven by the 
outcomes it justifies.

01:11:40.333 --> 01:11:46.666
The Democratic National Convention is thinking about 
bringing Bernie Sanders back to run for president in 2020.

01:11:46.666 --> 01:11:49.333
Can you imagine? Like, what if he gets elected?

01:11:49.333 --> 01:11:51.166
I seriously hope not.

01:11:51.166 --> 01:11:56.458
Hopefully all this stuff goes down and there is an awakening
 and everyone lines up behind President Trump.

01:11:56.458 --> 01:11:59.041
I'm fed up with the attacks on President Trump,

01:11:59.041 --> 01:12:02.916
I think he's the greatest president that we'll have in our 
lifetimes,

01:12:02.916 --> 01:12:04.791
and I'm grateful for all he's doing,

01:12:04.791 --> 01:12:08.750
and I'm proudly running for congress in Georgia's 14th 
district.

01:12:08.750 --> 01:12:13.583
The reason they aren’t more bothered by Q constantly getting
 things wrong,

01:12:13.583 --> 01:12:18.583
why they aren’t more bothered by the extreme inconsistencies
 and outright contradictions,

01:12:18.583 --> 01:12:21.541
by the claims that are just materially wrong,

01:12:21.541 --> 01:12:29.125
is because it gives them power over others who are bound by 
something as weak and flimsy as reality.

01:12:29.125 --> 01:12:33.791
They claim to be against corruption while hanging their 
hopes on an openly corrupt man,

01:12:33.791 --> 01:12:36.541
and that naked hypocrisy is the point.

01:12:36.541 --> 01:12:41.125
They will effortlessly carve out an exception because it 
makes them exceptional.

01:12:41.125 --> 01:12:45.458
They engage in wild hypocrisy as an act of domination,

01:12:45.458 --> 01:12:49.625
adhering to something demonstrably untrue out of spite,

01:12:49.625 --> 01:12:54.375
because they believe that power belongs to those with the 
greatest will to take it,

01:12:54.375 --> 01:12:59.708
and what greater sign of will than the ability to override 
truth?

01:12:59.708 --> 01:13:06.458
Their will is a hammer that they are useing to beat reality 
itself into a shape of their choosing,

01:13:06.458 --> 01:13:11.541
a simple world where reality is exactly what it looks like 
through their eyes,

01:13:11.541 --> 01:13:17.708
devoid of complexity, devoid of change, where they are right
 and their enemies are silent.

01:13:17.708 --> 01:13:22.708
They are trying to build a Flat Earth.

01:13:22.708 --> 01:16:16.250
[Intense music]

